    <string name="disclaimer">Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_summary">Flowpay never touches your money or your UPI PIN. It only dials your bank\'s *99# / UPI 123 flow for you. Tap to read the full disclaimer.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_text">Flowpay is a free, open-source app. It is not a bank, wallet, or payment processor, and it never holds, moves, or has access to your money.\n\nAll Flowpay does is dial for you. It automates your bank\'s *99# / UPI 123 (UPI 123PAY) menu. Every payment is authorised and processed directly by you, your bank, and NPCI over your mobile network, exactly as if you had dialled it yourself. Flowpay is not affiliated with or endorsed by NPCI or any bank.\n\nYour UPI PIN never touches Flowpay. The app does not use Android accessibility services, screen reading, or any form of input capture. You enter your PIN only inside your bank\'s own *99# / IVR flow, where Flowpay cannot see it, intercept it, or store it.\n\nYour data stays on your device. Flowpay reads incoming bank SMS only while a payment is in progress, and only to detect the confirmation. It never uploads your messages, contacts, or transaction history anywhere.\n\nBy continuing, you confirm that you have read and understood this.</string>
    
